text: ["Afflict 4 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, defending player loses 4 life.)\\nWhenever Wildfire Eternal attacks and isn't blocked, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from your hand without paying its mana cost.", 'Choose one —\\n• Abrade deals 3 damage to target creature.\\n• Destroy target artifact.', "Double strike\\nEternalize {3}{W}{W} ({3}{W}{W}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Create a token that's a copy of it, except it's a 4/4 black Zombie Cat with no mana cost. Eternalize only as a sorcery.)", 'You may play lands from your graveyard.']
flavor: ['"This world was once so much more than the confines of Naktamun."']
artist: ['Florian de Gesincourt', 'Joe Slucher', 'Kev Walker', 'Yongjae Choi']
